# Cloudflare Pages redirects. https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Canonical host is the apex getculprit.app; www 301s to it (§4/§12 #4).
# NOTE: for this to fire, www.getculprit.app must be attached as a custom domain
# on the Pages project. The more robust alternative is a zone-level Redirect Rule
# in the Cloudflare dashboard — see README "Deploy". This file is the backstop.
https://www.getculprit.app/* https://getculprit.app/:splat 301

# Serve our SVG mark for the implicit /favicon.ico request from older clients.
/favicon.ico /favicon.svg 301
